            <span>Federal Law 41/2022 and the civil route</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/divorce-lawyer-abu-dhabi/" class="related-card">
            <strong>Divorce Lawyer Abu Dhabi</strong>
            <span>Abu Dhabi courts and finding the right lawyer</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/dubai-vs-abu-dhabi-divorce/" class="related-card">
            <strong>Dubai vs Abu Dhabi Divorce</strong>
            <span>How the two emirates compare</span>
